{
  "id": "m32l1",
  "title": {
    "es": "Bases: binario y hexadecimal",
    "en": "Bases: binary and hexadecimal"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Otras formas de escribir números"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "El mismo número se puede escribir en distintas bases. `bin(n)` y `hex(n)` dan la representación con prefijo (`0b`, `0x`); `format(n, 'b')` y `format(n, 'x')` la dan sin prefijo."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print(bin(5), hex(255))",
          "print(format(5, 'b'), format(255, 'x'))",
          "print(int('101', 2), int('ff', 16))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "0b101 0xff",
          "101 ff",
          "5 255"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`int(texto, base)` hace el camino inverso: interpreta un texto en esa base y da el entero."
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Binario y hexadecimal son el pan de cada día en redes y seguridad (máscaras, direcciones, volcados)."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Other ways to write numbers"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The same number can be written in different bases. `bin(n)` and `hex(n)` give the prefixed form (`0b`, `0x`); `format(n, 'b')` and `format(n, 'x')` give it without prefix."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print(bin(5), hex(255))",
          "print(format(5, 'b'), format(255, 'x'))",
          "print(int('101', 2), int('ff', 16))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "0b101 0xff",
          "101 ff",
          "5 255"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`int(text, base)` goes the other way: it parses text in that base into an integer."
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Binary and hex are everyday tools in networking and security (masks, addresses, dumps)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m32l1e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `a_binario(n)` que devuelva la representación binaria de n SIN prefijo (usa format).",
        "en": "Define `a_binario(n)` returning n's binary representation WITHOUT prefix (use format)."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def a_binario(n):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def a_binario(n):",
        "    return format(n, 'b')"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "format(n, 'b') no añade el 0b."
        ],
        "en": [
          "format(n, 'b') doesn't add the 0b."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "a_binario",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                5
              ],
              "expected": "101"
            },
            {
              "args": [
                0
              ],
              "expected": "0"
            },
            {
              "args": [
                8
              ],
              "expected": "1000"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m32l1e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `desde_hex(texto)` que convierta un texto hexadecimal en su número entero.",
        "en": "Define `desde_hex(texto)` converting a hex text into its integer."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def desde_hex(texto):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def desde_hex(texto):",
        "    return int(texto, 16)"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "int(texto, 16)."
        ],
        "en": [
          "int(texto, 16)."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "desde_hex",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                "ff"
              ],
              "expected": 255
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "10"
              ],
              "expected": 16
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "a"
              ],
              "expected": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}